{"ticker":"AVAV","updated":"2026-11-13T22:39:50Z","profile":{"longName":"AeroVironment, Inc.","shortName":"AeroVironment, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.avinc.com","fullTimeEmployees":3991,"marketCap":5972448768,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":26.659225,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9822595,"pegRatio":1.07,"targetMeanPrice":212.1987,"targetHighPrice":315.0,"targetLowPrice":148.57,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.057,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.26471,"operatingMargins":-0.00599,"profitMargins":-0.10127,"totalRevenue":2002658944,"beta":1.403,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":408.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":100.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"AeroVironment, Inc., a defense technology provider, designs, develops, produces, delivers, and supports a portfolio of robotic systems and related services for government agencies and businesses in the United States and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Autonomous Systems; and Space, Cyber and Directed Energy. The company provides uncrewed aircraft systems (UAS), which include small and medium UAS, and kinesis command and control software; and counter-UAS and precision strike, a loitering munitions solution that deliver actionable intelligence and precision firepower modern warfighters, including precision strike, radio frequency and kinetic C-UAS, and electronic warfare systems. It also offers autonomy, AI, and platform technologies; unmanned maritime; and uncrewed ground systems. The company provides digital beamforming technology, a multi-band/beam software defined antenna tile that allows simultaneous communication with multiple satellites; laser communications, a data transmission systems for space operations; space-qualified hardware for line of sight stabilization and control electronics in low, medium, and geostationary earth orbit, as well as cislunar orbits; phased array antenna technology to supports hypersonic telemetry and tracking, and other missile testing; and directed energy solution. It also offers cyber solutions for national security and","summary_zh":"AeroVironment, Inc. 是一家國防技術供應商，為美國和國際上的政府機構和企業設計、開發、生產、交付和支援一系列機器人系統及相關服務。該公司分為兩個部門：自主系統部門；以及空間、網路和定向能源。該公司提供無人駕駛飛機系統（UAS），包括中小型無人機以及kinesis指揮和控制軟體；反無人機和精確打擊，這是一種徘徊彈藥解決方案，可為現代作戰人員提供可操作的情報和精確火力，包括精確打擊、射頻和動能反無人機以及電子戰系統。它還提供自主、人工智慧和平台技術；無人航海；和無人地面系統。該公司提供數位波束成形技術，這是一種多頻段/波束軟體定義的天線塊，允許與多個衛星同時通信；雷射通信，一種用於空間操作的數據傳輸系統；用於低、中、地球靜止軌道以及地月軌道視線穩定和控制電子設備的空間級硬體；相控陣天線技術支援高超音速射測和追蹤以及其他其他定向能量解決方案。它還提供國家安全和網路解決方案","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":245.27,"h":251.75,"l":243.44,"c":251.04,"v":940500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":254.48,"h":266.42,"l":253.14,"c":265.87,"v":1348600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":265.68,"h":274.52,"l":262.39,"c":272.07,"v":1112500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":278.42,"h":288.0,"l":275.81,"c":283.43,"v":1529900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":283.59,"h":289.37,"l":277.94,"c":278.55,"v":1991900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":278.27,"h":289.51,"l":275.44,"c":288.08,"v":870400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":293.32,"h":301.12,"l":291.78,"c":298.61,"v":1588400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":302.04,"h":307.11,"l":297.46,"c":301.52,"v":1378200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":293.08,"h":302.48,"l":278.1,"c":301.79,"v":1164300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":303.36,"h":305.01,"l":294.0,"c":301.2,"v":752800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":310.42,"h":317.11,"l":305.31,"c":308.69,"v":1445400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":307.68,"h":316.6,"l":303.72,"c":314.89,"v":1029900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":318.17,"h":346.24,"l":318.0,"c":346.08,"v":2075400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":354.45,"h":363.77,"l":349.71,"c":360.28,"v":1571500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":374.43,"h":383.8,"l":366.82,"c":374.64,"v":1683700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":385.39,"h":392.82,"l":373.03,"c":391.88,"v":1823600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":390.73,"h":400.01,"l":386.01,"c":395.13,"v":1459400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":399.77,"h":410.75,"l":389.99,"c